&lt;p&gt;This is &lt;strong&gt;not &lt;/strong&gt;a support role - it’s an entry point into Talent Acquisition. Our goal is to build a lasting partnership. We’re eager to consider high-performing interns for full-time roles to continue shaping Picnic&#39;s future together.&lt;/p&gt;
