&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job title:&lt;/strong&gt; Principal Engineer&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;London / Bristol / Edinburgh&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Enterprise Architecture&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; £120,000 - £160,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Director of Enterprise Architecture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is based in London, Bristol or Edinburgh&amp;nbsp;and requires existing right to work in the UK.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;303&quot; data-local-id=&quot;71635837-a0ff-40e4-8b75-a1ff2b4444d0&quot;&gt;As a Principal Software Engineer at Kaluza, you will be the leading technical authority for a major global product area comprising multiple modules. You will lead innovation on some of the most complex, ambiguous, and large-scale solutions, aligning them with target architecture standards and contributing to the creation of a scalable platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;651&quot; data-local-id=&quot;afe318c5-d169-4335-980d-c55899c830d5&quot;&gt;You’ll have a broad sphere of influence, enabling multiple teams and serving as a strategic partner to our architecture leadership team and our community of principal and staff engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;840&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d1958d8-2004-4ea0-821c-a0ebcadb4a0e&quot;&gt;Your impact will come mostly from &#39;hands-off&#39; work; you’ll not be expected to write code day-to-day. But for some challenges, you may need to dive into code-level design or help build a proof-of-concept.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideally you’ll have/be&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1072&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c232f15f-f0a4-4008-a7b5-f91f1cfafc20&quot;&gt;Architect modern distributed, cloud-based systems applying modern architecture and engineering practices in an enterprise software environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1219&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8dba6a70-6d5c-45e2-a3af-1ccdaa41a861&quot;&gt;Shape and influence technical vision and product roadmaps to align with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1310&quot; data-local-id=&quot;562ddf14-2519-461d-9844-e47621078721&quot;&gt;Provide hands-on leadership, making appropriate technical choices to satisfy requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1404&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7a0244ae-b45c-4845-88d4-50316da986b9&quot;&gt;Mentor and guide engineers in delivering autonomous, loosely coupled distributed systems with proven architectural principles and patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1547&quot; data-local-id=&quot;77346099-2aa3-43c1-91d9-749290fea5e1&quot;&gt;Lead technical due diligence and make high-stakes decisions with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1627&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7e1a1e9f-a262-4aec-8e83-9332f726304a&quot;&gt;Deliver results, influence diverse audiences, and orchestrate cross-functional solutions spanning multiple product features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1755&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c409df9a-e0b3-4f6b-a9a3-39d995612adf&quot;&gt;Engage effectively with both technical teams and executive leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1826&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7cb74d57-f395-456f-b7cf-298b271ed930&quot;&gt;Work independently and collaboratively, bringing strong opinions while respecting others, communicating openly, and maintaining self-awareness with a continuous growth mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will set you apart&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2035&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a0dbc1d1-8544-470c-ae8a-18a2b9c5f141&quot;&gt;Experience enabling engineering teams to use AI and delivering AI/ML powered solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2126&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4e471dc5-7261-4e8c-ad4b-265e11f79d54&quot;&gt;Demonstrable experience in architecting solutions in complex business domains, particularly interface design and data modelling, ideally with experience in AWS and API design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2305&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1d87f974-8329-4a1b-9b26-2dfa45af34f8&quot;&gt;Proven track record delivering global &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;B2B2C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; SaaS (energy or other mission‑critical industries).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2404&quot; data-local-id=&quot;769f5e5e-483c-4ef8-ba0e-ff433059a8a0&quot;&gt;Success driving adoption of modern engineering practices (e.g. DevOps, CI/CD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2486&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d6312d22-3a41-4bcc-837e-9eee49ca8fda&quot;&gt;Experience leading teams through significant changes in ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2562&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f6f5546f-363b-4985-91fd-d58666e49784&quot;&gt;Ability to ramp up rapidly in new domains and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business: Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance + Virtual GP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Furthr - a Climate Action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Mortgage Advice and Eye Tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks at Work - access to thousands of retail discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% Flex Fund - to spend on the benefits you want most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Leave Policy - With no qualifying service periods, including 26 weeks full pay if you have a new addition to your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal Learning Budget - Upskill, learn and grow!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Budget&lt;br&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Find out more about working in&lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com/&quot;&gt; Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape how Graphcore products move from hardware design into reliable volume manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Staff Manufacturing Product Engineer, you will take a leading role in supporting NPI development and volume production across complex hardware products. You will connect design, test, quality and supply chain decisions with real manufacturing outcomes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your work will help ensure products are manufacturable, resilient and ready for supplier capability. You will provide DfM feedback that improves PCB and system design before issues reach production.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will work closely with contract manufacturers, especially during NPI and early volume manufacture. You will drive yield improvement, analyse production data and resolve L6 manufacturing issues.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role suits someone who enjoys practical engineering ownership across design and production. You will travel to Taiwan and work close to suppliers shaping next generation manufacturing technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team and culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the Manufacturing and Technology Process team within Operations. The team works across Bristol, Cambridge and Taiwan, close to foundry, package assembly and PCBA partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work happens through clear ownership, supplier engagement and fast feedback into design teams. You will speak up early when manufacturability, yield or capability needs attention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team values evidence, responsibility and strong cross-regional relationships. Decisions are made through engineering judgement, data and direct accountability for manufacturing performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Strong fault diagnosis, problem solving and failure analysis skills, including ICT to SMT debug&lt;br&gt;· Thorough understanding of Automated surface mount assembly processes and manufacturing methodologies&lt;br&gt;· Working knowledge of L10 mechanical design and system build, ideally for HPC products&lt;br&gt;· Ability to connect silicon, package and PCB interactions into clear DfM feedback&lt;br&gt;· Experienced in statistical analysis tools (e.g JMP, SQL, Python)&lt;br&gt;· Experience using continuous improvement methods, including SPC and DOE&lt;br&gt;· Strong interpersonal skills for supplier-facing, cross-functional and cross-regional engineering work&lt;br&gt;· Extensive experience in a similar manufacturing facing role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;While we have outlined a set of requirements, we value transferable skills and diverse experiences. If you meet most of our essential criteria, we encourage you to submit an application and showcase how your background makes you a strong candidate.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Flexible working: Balance your work and personal life with greater flexibility&lt;br&gt;· Generous leave: Take time to rest, recharge and enjoy life outside of work&lt;br&gt;· Retirement planning support: Up to 5% matched pension&lt;br&gt;· Phantom equity: Share in Graphcore’s success&lt;br&gt;· Workplace experience: Enjoy thoughtfully designed office spaces for collaboration, with free food and an on-site barista to support your day&lt;br&gt;· Peace of mind protection: Income protection and life assurance to provide financial security for you and your loved ones&lt;br&gt;· Flexible benefits: Tailor your benefits package with a choice of additional options, including private medical insurance and dental cover&lt;br&gt;· Optional benefits: Dental cover, health cash plan, private medical insurance, cycle to work scheme, give as you earn&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome people from all backgrounds and experiences and are committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone can do their best work.&lt;br&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer and recognise that everyone brings different strengths and perspectives. If you need any adjustments during the interview process, just let us know - we’re happy to support you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sponsorship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the UK. Unfortunately, we are unable to provide visa sponsorship or support visa applications for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Team at Graphcore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graphcore is one of the world’s leading innovators in Artificial Intelligence compute. It is developing hardware, software and systems infrastructure that will unlock the next generation of AI breakthroughs and power the widespread adoption of AI solutions across every industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the SoftBank Group, Graphcore is a member of an elite family of companies responsible for some of the world’s most transformative technologies. Together, they share a bold vision: to enable Artificial Super Intelligence and ensure its benefits are accessible to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graphcore’s teams are drawn from diverse backgrounds and bring a broad range of skills and perspectives. A melting pot of AI research specialists, silicon designers, software engineers and systems architects, Graphcore brings together deep expertise to solve complex problems and deliver meaningful progress in AI compute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to turn hardware design into stronger manufacturing performance, we’d love to hear from you. Apply now to help shape how Graphcore products are built.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Fanatics Markets:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Markets is the real-money prediction and trading app where you can invest in moments you care about. Built on a secure platform, we let users predict real-world outcomes and trade on events they actually follow — from sports and entertainment to political elections and beyond. Our mission is to redefine how fans engage with the moments and markets that matter most. We&#39;re looking for the right people to help us build the future of prediction markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This Staff Software Engineer role is an individual contributor position with technical leadership and significant ownership across our full stack: the web application customers use to interact with our product and the backend systems that power it. You&#39;ll combine hands-on engineering with responsibility for shaping architecture, setting technical direction, and enabling engineers across teams to deliver effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether your deepest expertise is in frontend or backend engineering, you&#39;ll apply that strength across the platform while making meaningful contributions on the other side of the stack. Joining a product at an exciting early stage, you&#39;ll help define its technical foundations, identify the highest-impact engineering challenges, and turn ambiguous problems into clear plans that balance customer needs, delivery speed, and long-term reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your impact will extend beyond the systems you build. You&#39;ll lead complex initiatives spanning teams, mentor engineers, and establish practices that improve engineering quality and effectiveness. You&#39;ll also shape our approach to AI-assisted development while building systems that can handle millions of events daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the engineering side, we&#39;re pioneering the use of AI as a code collaborator. We need engineers who have gone beyond experimentation — who actively use Claude Code, Codex, GitHub Copilot, or similar tools to ship production code faster while maintaining exceptional quality standards, and who can help others adopt these workflows responsibly and effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for major areas of the Markets platform, aligning architectural decisions with product strategy and guiding their implementation across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and delivery of complex, scalable systems and customer experiences, contributing hands-on in React, Next.js, and TypeScript or backend services in Go, while making meaningful contributions across the stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve ambiguous engineering problems spanning team or system boundaries, turning them into clear proposals, delivery plans, and measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own critical initiatives end-to-end, from discovery and technical specifications through implementation, instrumentation, deployment, monitoring, and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, design, platform, and infrastructure teams to make informed tradeoffs across customer experience, accessibility, performance, security, reliability, and delivery speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define architecture and integration patterns for frontend applications, backend APIs, and event-driven systems, with particular attention to correctness in markets, orders, and transactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the design of experimentation capabilities, including feature flags and A/B tests, so teams can validate ideas quickly and safely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate scaling constraints, reliability risks, and technical debt; build alignment on pragmatic improvements and drive them through to completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise engineering standards through design reviews, code reviews, testing strategies, observability, and safe deployment practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers and develop technical leaders, helping teams make sound decisions and solve problems independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and evolve standards for AI-assisted development, including appropriate use cases, review expectations, security safeguards, and validation strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure and improve engineering effectiveness, sharing tools and practices that increase delivery speed without compromising quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead through influence in an early-stage product environment, creating clarity, unblocking teams, and establishing ways of working that support growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial experience building and operating highly scalable production systems, with demonstrated impact at Staff level or equivalent scope, including technical leadership across teams or major platform areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in either user-facing web applications built with JavaScript/TypeScript and React or backend services built with languages such as Go, Java, or Python, alongside the ability to reason across the full stack. If you&#39;re frontend-strong, you don&#39;t need to arrive fluent in Go, but you should be comfortable engaging with backend architecture and system tradeoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of setting technical direction and delivering complex initiatives from ambiguous requirements through to measurable production outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural judgment, including the ability to assess tradeoffs, establish clear system boundaries, and evolve systems as product requirements and scale change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shaping React architecture, component-driven development, and modern state management using tools such as Next.js, TanStack Query, Tailwind, or Zustand; or deep backend experience with data modeling, distributed systems, and event-driven architecture using technologies such as Postgres and Kafka/PubSub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of your primary language&#39;s features, idioms, and best practices, with experience establishing standards adopted beyond your immediate team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of performance, reliability, and security, including responsive design and accessibility on the frontend or scalability, observability, data integrity, and failure handling on the backend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining API contracts and collaborating across product, platform, and infrastructure teams to deliver reliable systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shaping CI/CD pipelines, testing strategies, and safe deployment practices across services or applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead through influence, build alignment across teams, and communicate technical decisions clearly to engineers and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of mentoring engineers, strengthening technical decision-making, and increasing the effectiveness of others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience using AI tools such as Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, or Copilot to ship production code, with sound judgment about their limitations and appropriate validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specific examples of improving development workflows, with evidence of their impact on delivery speed, quality, or engineering productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team-first approach, with the judgment to move between strategic technical work and hands-on delivery according to the needs of the product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to create clarity in a high-growth environment where priorities evolve and decisions must be made quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills, including experience aligning teams and navigating dependencies within large enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;You don&#39;t need to tick every box — deep strength in one area, demonstrated technical leadership, and a willingness to learn go a long way.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience shaping technical foundations in early-stage or high-growth startup environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with real-money transaction systems, including financial correctness, auditability, and regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing technical roadmaps or leading architectural changes adopted across multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in building developer tools or improving engineering productivity at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing AI-assisted engineering practices across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to open-source projects or the technical community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc in Computer Science or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, your interview and onboarding experience may include in-person components, such as onsite interviews or Launching into Better: LIVE—a multi-day cultural immersion in New York City for full-time, non-seasonal hires. These sessions are designed to build connections and bring our culture to life, though specific travel and participation requirements will be confirmed based on your role and location. Your recruiter will provide clear guidance at each stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to build the future of sports trading? If you possess some of these skills but not all of them, we still encourage you to apply! Please note that visa sponsorship is not available for this position. We are open to fully remote candidates based in the United Kingdom. Remote employees may also be eligible for a home office setup stipend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.organization-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soho, London&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid working: 3 days in the office Tues - Thurs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To provide technical leadership and hands-on contribution within a data engineering team, designing, building, and optimizing robust data pipelines and infrastructure for a global sports betting and media business. This role is crucial in delivering high-quality data solutions that support LiveScore’s strategic goals and embody our commitment to being Fan Driven and a Champion of Sport. You will mentor junior engineers and ensure technical excellence in your domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At LiveScore Group, we’re the proud home of three of the most exciting brands in the sports and gaming world: LiveScore, LiveScore Bet and Virgin Bet. A fully owned and operated ecosystem that converges the two worlds of sports media and sports betting. We’re proud of the high ratings for our commitment to excellence and fueling fan’s passion for sport driving us to the top.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t just lead; we innovate. Our cutting-edge products and immersive experiences set the standard, but it’s our people who truly make the difference. Every day, our team embody our values: adaptability, teamwork, a fan-driven approach, and an ever-curious mindset that fuels our ambition. As we scale and continue to create a culture that allows all employees to thrive, we know we need the most talented people with diverse backgrounds, perspectives and skills. If you’re good at what you do, come and join us. The more inclusive we are, the more amazing experiences we can create for our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We know that job descriptions can sometimes seem daunting, and you might not feel you tick every box. But, if you’re passionate about the role and have relevant experience, we want to hear from you!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership and Guidance:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a primary technical point of contact and subject matter expert for specific data engineering projects or domains, guiding team members through complex technical challenges and promoting innovative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Data Solution Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, develop, test, and deploy highly scalable, reliable, and fault-tolerant data pipelines and ETL/ELT processes. This includes data ingestion from diverse sources, data transformation, and data loading into various data stores (e.g., data warehouses, data lakes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural Implementation:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Data Architects to translate architectural blueprints and standards into concrete implementations, ensuring new data components align with the overall data strategy and infrastructure requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship and Skill Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively mentor and coach junior and mid-level data engineers, providing constructive feedback, sharing technical knowledge, and fostering their growth in coding, data modeling, and general data engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Contribution:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a significant hands-on role in coding, data modeling, infrastructure-as-code development, and platform configuration, leading by example and ensuring high-quality output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Quality and Performance Assurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Take direct responsibility for ensuring the quality, integrity, and performance of data assets within their assigned domain or projects, implementing monitoring, validation, and optimization strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Efficiency and Cost Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify and implement technical optimizations for data processing, storage, and infrastructure utilization to improve efficiency, reduce operational costs, and enhance system performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code Review and Best Practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and participate in rigorous code reviews, advocating for and enforcing engineering best practices, coding standards, and architectural patterns to maintain high code quality and system stability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Diagnose, troubleshoot, and provide effective solutions for highly complex data-related issues, incidents, and performance bottlenecks, often working under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate effectively with other engineering teams, product managers, data scientists, and business stakeholders to understand data requirements, integrate solutions, and provide technical insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills, Knowledge and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Data Pipeline Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven, in-depth experience as a senior or lead data engineer with a strong portfolio of hands-on contributions to designing, building, and optimizing complex, large-scale data pipelines and ETL/ELT processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Data Warehousing (EDW) and Data Modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong practical experience with EDW concepts, principles, and implementation, specifically including the design and practical application of a single, integrated data model for analytical purposes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Data Platforms:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with cloud-native data services and infrastructure on at least one major cloud provider (e.g., AWS services like S3, Redshift, Glue, EMR; GCP services like BigQuery, Dataflow, Pub/Sub; Azure services like Data Lake, Synapse Analytics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cost Optimization Strategies:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to identify, propose, and implement technical solutions that lead to significant cost savings in data processing, storage, and infrastructure within a large-scale data environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert proficiency in software development methodologies (e.g., Agile, Scrum), version control (Git), CI/CD pipelines, automated testing, and comprehensive understanding of software engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional coding skills in at least one relevant programming language (e.g., Python, Scala, Java, JavaScript, C/C++), with a focus on writing clean, efficient, and maintainable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Database Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience with various database technologies including relational databases (e.g., PostgreSQL, MySQL), NoSQL databases (e.g., MongoDB, Cassandra), and analytical data warehouses (e.g., Snowflake, Redshift, BigQuery).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Architecture Principles:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of data architecture patterns (e.g., Data Mesh, Data Lakehouse, Lambda/Kappa architectures), distributed systems, and their practical application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience in developing and maintaining robust and auditable data solutions for regulatory reporting, particularly within the gaming or other highly regulated industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in AI prompting alongside staying ahead of emerging AI technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; A natural leader who can effectively guide, inspire, and technically mentor junior and mid-level engineers. Possesses the ability to break down complex problems, provide clear direction, and foster a learning environment, thereby enhancing team capabilities and promoting adherence to best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can we offer?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Performance Bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Working Agreements where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Healthcare Scheme + Employee Enhanced Assistance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Family Leave - Maternity, Shared Parental &amp;amp; Adoption Leave: up to 6 months at full pay and 6 months at half pay. Paternity leave: up to 4 weeks at full pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised Gym Membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Travel Card Loan &amp;amp; Ride to Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance (x3 salary)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributory Pension Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virgin Family: Giving you access to exclusive Virgin offers and experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thursday drinks in the office and regular socials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Motive empowers the people who run physical operations with tools to make their work safer, more productive, and more profitable. For the first time ever, safety, operations and finance teams can manage their drivers, vehicles, equipment, and fleet related spend in a single system. Combined with industry leading AI, the Motive platform gives you complete visibility and control, and significantly reduces manual workloads by automating and simplifying tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Motive serves nearly 100,000 customers – from Fortune 500 enterprises to small businesses – across a wide range of industries, including transportation and logistics, construction, energy, field service, manufacturing, agriculture, food and beverage, retail, and the public sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://gomotive.com&quot;&gt;gomotive.com&lt;/a&gt; to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Staff Product Manager, UK Market, you will define and execute Motive&#39;s product strategy for the UK, with the opportunity to expand your scope to continental Europe over time. You will own the commercial roadmap: where we compete, what we build, and in what order. You will then deliver it, working with engineering teams and peers across the product organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;International expansion is one of the most important strategic initiatives at Motive. You will partner closely with sales, marketing, customer success, finance, product leaders, designers, and engineers to bring our products to customers who face different regulations, vehicles, hardware, and buying needs than in the US. You will be a senior voice in the room as leadership decides where to invest, and you will see those decisions through to shipped product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To succeed, you must be comfortable influencing leaders across the company and navigating complex technical and organizational challenges. We operate like a startup within a larger organization, so you will wear many hats. Being entrepreneurial, commercially minded, and growth-oriented is critical.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the UK product strategy. Decide which segments, products, and use cases to prioritise to win, grounded in customer, competitive, and regulatory insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align the company on the right commercial roadmap. Work with GTM, finance, and executive leadership to turn market opportunity into prioritised roadmaps, business cases, and investment asks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute with engineering. Partner with multiple engineering teams and product peers to scope, sequence, and deliver UK requirements, including regional feature adaptations, compliance products, and hardware and integration needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a deep understanding of UK customers, from fleet operators to drivers, through regular customer visits and field research, and translate what you learn into clear product requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence across the product organization so that shared platform and product teams deliver against UK priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish success metrics for the region, such as win rate, market coverage, adoption, and revenue, and report progress to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the broader international strategy through market research, benchmarking, and financial and risk assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in product management at a B2B company or on operational products, with a track record of leading complex, cross-functional initiatives at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product sense and execution, with the commercial judgement to tie roadmap decisions to business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep analytical skills and the ability to synthesise insight for an executive audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to influence up and across, including senior engineering and business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a startup or new team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in the UK. London preferred for in-office collaboration. Ability to travel within the UK for customer visits and field research (about 1-2 times per quarter) and to San Francisco 1-2 times per year for team meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with products similar to Motive&#39;s, such as connected devices, telematics, fleet or asset management, IoT hardware plus software, or AI video and safety products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with international launches or localization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Creating a diverse and inclusive workplace is one of Motive&#39;s core values. We are an equal opportunity employer and welcome people of different backgrounds, experiences, abilities and perspectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please review our Candidate Privacy Notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-link&quot; href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1X9AbvQHki8zZCyjDjip1g0NtdZHcykJc/view?usp=drive_link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;UK Candidate Privacy Notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nqdWTJ7WJJikhj1Yhlo4jxDRA_6yXZbd/view&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_-8012333603671085849gmail-docs-internal-guid-8821a356-7fff-42cb-93df-e4c910033371&quot;&gt;The applicant must be authorized to receive and access those commodities and technologies controlled under U.S. Export Administration Regulations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;It is Motive&#39;s policy to require that employees be authorized to receive access to Motive products and technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Regarding US-based roles, depending on your role and primary work location, Motive Technologies, Inc. (“Employer”) discloses candidates may be required to execute a non-compete covenant with the Employer. This requirement does not apply to lawyers, interns, or employees working in CA, MN, MT, ND, OK, or where otherwise prohibited by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Non-compete covenant terms in all other jurisdictions will be subject to the applicable statutory requirements, including but not limited to, procedures, industry related prohibitions, or salary and compensation thresholds.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All job postings are for existing vacancies. Please note; some interviews or new-hire training sessions may be held in person at one of our global offices.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The world’s most sophisticated companies rely on AlphaSense to remove uncertainty from decision-making. With market intelligence and search built on proven AI, AlphaSense delivers insights that matter from content you can trust. Our universe of public and private content includes equity research, company filings, event transcripts, expert calls, news, trade journals, and clients’ own research content. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The acquisition of Tegus by AlphaSense in 2024 advances our shared mission to empower professionals to make smarter decisions through AI-driven market intelligence. Together, AlphaSense and Tegus will accelerate growth, innovation, and content expansion, with complementary product and content capabilities that enable users to unearth even more comprehensive insights from thousands of content sets. Our platform is trusted by over 6,000 enterprise customers, including a majority of the S&amp;amp;P 500. Founded in 2011, AlphaSense is headquartered in New York City with more than 2,000 employees across the globe and offices in the U.S., U.K., Finland, India, Singapore, Canada, and Ireland. Come join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;The Sales Development team at AlphaSense sits at the forefront of our company’s prospect engagement and pipeline generation efforts. We identify potential prospects, leverage diverse outreach strategies, engage in strategic conversations with stakeholders, and collaborate with Account Executives to expand our footprint within new and existing accounts, ultimately generating revenue for the organization. At our core, we are a dynamic team of highly motivated self-starters who are passionate about the AlphaSense product. We rely on product and industry knowledge to communicate the value of our solution and convert interested prospects into qualified leads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are looking for a passionate, data-driven Senior Sales Development Manager to help accelerate pipeline generation and drive new business growth. This individual will attract, retain, and cultivate exceptional Sales Development talent and future Account Executives within our team. Your leadership will be key in ensuring our team achieves ambitious goals and continues to thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role, 3 days per week in our London office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate Trainer and Coach:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a deep passion for training, coaching, and developing sales talent, ensuring your team reaches their highest potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Problem Solver: &lt;/strong&gt;You excel at identifying new and innovative ways to drive top-of-funnel growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Thinker: &lt;/strong&gt;You leverage data to make informed decisions and recommendations, ensuring strategies are backed by solid evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Natural Motivator: &lt;/strong&gt;You inspire and motivate your team to achieve ambitious goals, fostering a culture of excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptable and Resilient: &lt;/strong&gt;You remain composed and adaptable in a fast-paced, ever-changing environment, quickly adjusting strategies as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor the team to secure high-quality meetings with senior executives, driving the team to meet or exceed KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish effective sales development strategies that scale as the team grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner on the go-to-market strategy, including email, phone, and social messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively track and analyze key trends to inform data-driven decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and execute professional development programming to enable team members to succeed as Sales Development Representatives and prepare them for future roles in the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Talent Acquisition to identify and attract Sales Development talent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
