&lt;p&gt;📍London / Distributed (UK) | 💰 £86,100 - £101,300 (depending on experience) ➕ incentive awards tied to your performance |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers#benefits&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tDAT6VxoqQM&quot;&gt;Hear from the team&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐ About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a strategic, commercially minded, and data-driven &lt;strong&gt;Senior Strategy and Operations Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, who will be an individual contributor and help shape the future of Payments at Monzo. You’ll play a critical role in supporting the GM of Payments and the leadership team to define, measure, and drive our strategy - balancing long-term vision with the realities of day-to-day delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-ownership, high-impact role, ideal for someone who thrives on solving complex problems, is fuelled by strategic thinking, and enjoys using data to bring clarity to ambiguity. You’ll move seamlessly between blue-sky thinking and tactical execution - one day modelling the impact of a new product bet, the next helping optimise how we run the collective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll bring a birds-eye view across Payments’s portfolio - ensuring our goals, investments, and initiatives line up coherently with each other and with Monzo’s broader mission. And you’ll be the connective tissue that keeps us operating effectively: tracking performance, surfacing insights, and making sure we’re focused on what really matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving strategic clarity:&lt;/strong&gt; Supporting the GM of Payments and leadership team in defining, tracking, and evolving Payments’s strategic direction to align with Monzo’s wider mission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively dive into large, complex datasets to uncover insights, diagnose operational challenges, and independently design and implement scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translating data into action:&lt;/strong&gt; Building and maintaining data-informed views of performance across products, squads, and initiatives; using insights to inform priorities and trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Partnering closely with Product, Engineering, Data and Design teams to bridge the gap between ideas and strategic business execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning business performance rhythm:&lt;/strong&gt; Leading monthly business reviews, reporting, and governance materials to keep the collective aligned and accountable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping new opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; Scoping new bets through market sizing, commercial modelling, partnerships evaluation, and budget/forecast analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Making the org more effective:&lt;/strong&gt; Optimising how we balance KTLO, BAU, and growth work; supporting resourcing and squad setup decisions across the collective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connecting the dots:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensuring consistent communication and alignment across Payment squads, and with other Monzo collectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale &amp;amp; Geographic Expansion:&lt;/strong&gt; Playing a pivotal role in scaling our lending book and supporting launch operations as we expand our Borrowing products into new geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bringing teams together:&lt;/strong&gt; Leading Payments All Hands, goals processes, and strategic forums that ensure cohesion and momentum across the collective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if you have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a deeply strategic mind, capable of seeing the bigger picture, thinking in systems, and anticipating future trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional Problem-Solving Skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Your “superpower” is solving complex problems with analytical rigor, commercial viability, and execution certainty&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability &amp;amp; Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You’re a self-starter who thrives in ambiguity, adept at navigating complex, rapidly evolving environments, and driven by impact and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Influencing Without Authority:&lt;/strong&gt; You have an exceptional ability to connect the dots across different parts of the business, foster collaboration, and drive alignment without authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You’re comfortable making trade-offs and prioritisation decisions based on data, business impact, and resource constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Rigour&lt;/strong&gt;: A strong analytical skillset with a proven track record of comfortably navigating large datasets to solve unstructured problems independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience working cross-functionally with highly technical teams such as Machine Learning and Data/Analytics Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; You’re motivated by improving how teams work - finding ways to make organisations more efficient, scalable, and focused on what matters most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £86,100 - £101,300 (depending on experience) + incentive awards tied to your performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍 We&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK, with the expectation of working from the London office on occasional basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more!&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers#benefits&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈 The application journey has 4 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Phone call with Recruiter (30 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial behavioural video call with Hiring Manager (45 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical interview (60 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem solving interview (60 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our average process takes around 3–4 weeks, but we will always work around your availability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ll only close this role once we have enough applications for the next stage. Please submit your application as soon as possible to make sure you don’t miss out.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. You can read them&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-NZ1 #LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here&#39;s a summary of the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about turning engaged prospects into customers and building marketing programs that directly influence revenue? As a Senior Field Marketing Manager, you&#39;ll partner closely with Sales, Customer Success, and Business Unit leaders to design and execute high-impact field marketing, customer engagement, and event strategies across the UK &amp;amp; Ireland and wider EMEA region. You&#39;ll play a key role in accelerating pipeline, progressing opportunities, and creating measurable commercial results through data-driven, customer-centric marketing initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here&#39;s a breakdown of what you&#39;ll do (not all of it, just the important stuff):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead integrated field marketing programs that accelerate opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;, support pipeline growth, and drive revenue impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute &lt;strong&gt;account-based marketing initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; for strategic target accounts and buying committees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and deliver engaging in-person and &lt;strong&gt;virtual events, including executive roundtables, workshops, webinars, and industry conferences&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales leadership to align marketing activities with account plans, active opportunities, and commercial priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create programs that support customer expansion, retention, advocacy, and renewal opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze campaign, event, and pipeline performance to optimize ROI and continuously improve results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;These are the essentials you&#39;ll need to get an interview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of &lt;strong&gt;B2B marketing experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including 3+ years in field marketing, regional marketing, or account-based marketing roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success delivering integrated marketing programs that &lt;strong&gt;accelerate sales cycles, influence pipeline, and contribute to bookings or revenue growth&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering directly with &lt;strong&gt;Sales teams, Customer Success and Commercial teams&lt;/strong&gt; and leaders to build account-focused marketing strategies and opportunity acceleration plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of complex &lt;strong&gt;B2B SaaS&lt;/strong&gt; buying journeys and multi-stakeholder decision-making processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;Salesforce&lt;/strong&gt; and a marketing automation platform such as Marketo or HubSpot.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use data, insights, and reporting to evaluate performance and drive marketing decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate AI tools to the daily workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, stakeholder management, and project management skills, with the ability to thrive in a fast-paced, collaborative environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be great if you had these too, but we&#39;ll support you if you don&#39;t:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within governance, risk, compliance, audit, or related enterprise software markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using sales engagement and intelligence tools such as Outreach, Gong or ZoomInfo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to regional or international marketing programs across EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting customer marketing, renewal, or advocacy initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have the opportunity to shape field marketing strategy for a growing business area, work directly with senior commercial stakeholders, and see the measurable impact of your work on pipeline and revenue. If you enjoy combining strategic thinking with hands-on execution and thrive in a collaborative, results-driven environment, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Diligent is the AI leader in governance, risk and compliance (GRC) SaaS solutions, helping more than 1 million users and 700,000 board members to clarify risk and elevate governance. The Diligent One Platform gives practitioners, the C-Suite and the board a consolidated view of their entire GRC practice so they can more effectively manage risk, build greater resilience and make better decisions, faster.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At Diligent, we&#39;re building the future with people who think boldly and move fast. &amp;nbsp;Whether you&#39;re designing systems that leverage large language models or part of a team reimaging workflows with AI, you&#39;ll help us unlock entirely new ways of working and thinking. &amp;nbsp;Curiosity is in our DNA, we look for individuals willing to ask the big questions and experiment fearlessly - those who embrace change not as a challenge, but as an opportunity. &amp;nbsp;The future belongs to those who keep learning, and we are building it together. &amp;nbsp;At Diligent, you’re not just building the future - you’re an agent of positive change, joining a global community on a mission to make an impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more at&amp;nbsp;diligent.com or follow us on&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA170dad44-6a69-e1e1-d720-601cd59ec77c&quot; class=&quot;x_x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/diligent-board-member-services/mycompany/verification/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;c606bc91-5052-4d3a-a1d1-ed00ede365d9&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA153deb8c-7641-f6fc-97cb-65df680002a3&quot; class=&quot;x_x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/DiligentCorporation/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;07f4e461-6294-4482-a624-e58c27cd6199&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;2&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Diligent Offers You&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creativity is ingrained in our culture.&lt;/strong&gt; We are innovative collaborators by nature. We thrive in exploring how things can be differently both in our internal processes and to help our clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We care about our people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Diligent offers a flexible work environment, global days of service, comprehensive health benefits, meeting free days, generous time off policy and wellness programs&amp;nbsp;to name a few&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have teams all over the world&lt;/strong&gt;. We may be headquartered in New York City, but we have office hubs in Washington D.C., Vancouver, London, Galway, Budapest, Munich, Bengaluru, Singapore, and Sydney.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity is important to us.&lt;/strong&gt; Growing, maintaining and promoting a diverse team is a top priority for us. We foster and encourage diversity through our Employee Resource Groups and provide access to resources and education to support the education of our team, facilitate dialogue, and foster understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diligent created the modern governance movement. Our world-changing idea is to empower leaders with the technology, insights and connections they need to drive greater impact and accountability – to lead with purpose. Our employees are passionate, smart, and creative people who not only want to help build the software company of the future, but who want to make the world a more sustainable, equitable and better place.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in New York, Diligent has offices in Washington D.C.,&amp;nbsp; London, Galway, Budapest, Vancouver, Bengaluru, Munich, Singapore and Sydney.  &amp;nbsp;To foster strong collaboration and connection, this role will follow a hybrid work model. If you are within a commuting distance to one of our Diligent office locations, you will be expected to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;work onsite at least 50% of the time.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe that in-person engagement helps drive innovation, teamwork, and a strong sense of community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Diligent is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based on race, color, religious creed, sex, national origin, ancestry, citizenship status, pregnancy, childbirth, physical disability, mental disability, age, military status, protected veteran status, marital status, registered domestic partner or civil union status, gender (including sex stereotyping and gender identity or expression), medical condition (including, but not limited to, cancer related or HIV/AIDS related), genetic information, or sexual orientation in accordance with applicable federal, state and local laws.&amp;nbsp;We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. See also&amp;nbsp;Diligent&#39;s&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/company/eeo-policy&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;5e90c823-c220-4ada-92af-0b9df69068d6&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;4&quot;&gt;EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/-/media/project/diligent/master/eeo-is-the-law-poster-eeocselfprintposter-and-ofccp-supplement-from-20170719.pdf?rev=96fafda8-f51d-44b6-a380-9af42898f526&amp;amp;hash=614AE342F4AB51A091EA3E15F84F7E49&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;25527b37-a96e-4ef3-af1f-248e2a881a45&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;5&quot;&gt;US EEOC&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/-/media/project/diligent/master/eeo-is-the-law-poster-eeocselfprintposter-and-ofccp-supplement-from-20170719.pdf?rev=96fafda8-f51d-44b6-a380-9af42898f526&amp;amp;hash=614AE342F4AB51A091EA3E15F84F7E49&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;25527b37-a96e-4ef3-af1f-248e2a881a45&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;6&quot;&gt;’&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/-/media/project/diligent/master/eeo-is-the-law-poster-eeocselfprintposter-and-ofccp-supplement-from-20170719.pdf?rev=96fafda8-f51d-44b6-a380-9af42898f526&amp;amp;hash=614AE342F4AB51A091EA3E15F84F7E49&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;25527b37-a96e-4ef3-af1f-248e2a881a45&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;7&quot;&gt;s Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;. We are a drug free workplace.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If you need assistance or an accommodation due to a disability, you may contact us at -----
&lt;div&gt;To support a fair and consistent hiring&amp;nbsp;process, we use AI&amp;nbsp;and digital automated tools to assist our recruitment team in organizing candidate data, surfacing relevant applications, coordinating&amp;nbsp;interview scheduling and summarizing interview notes. All final screening, evaluation, and hiring decisions are made by humans on our team. To learn more about how we collect, protect, and process your information, please review our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.diligent.com/legal/candidate-privacy&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;48c7a45d-2b3c-4bc9-99ec-639351abe71c&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Diligent, we recognize the value of a diverse global workforce. Visa sponsorship may be available for select positions based on business needs and specific role requirements. Sponsorship decisions are evaluated on a case-by-case basis, and eligibility should not be assumed for all opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment agencies:&lt;/strong&gt; Diligent does not accept unsolicited agency resumes. Please do not forward resumes to our jobs alias, Diligent employees or any other organization location. Diligent is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ReqID:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; FEQ427R149&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills: Networking, Security, Platform, DevOps, Databricks, Cloud - AWS, GCP, Azure, Infrastructure - First preference would be GCP experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter: Dina Hussain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Infrastructure &amp;amp; Platform Specialist Solutions Engineer, you will serve as a trusted technical advisor, helping enterprise customers with the architecture, administration, and security of their Databricks deployments on their cloud of choice (AWS, Azure, or GCP). You combine solid technical expertise with a growing ability to connect architecture decisions to customer outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Impact You Will Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide enterprise customers through the full lifecycle of Databricks on their cloud platform, including platform administration from initial architectural design to production deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect secure, scalable enterprise deployments that satisfy complex cloud networking (virtual networks, private connectivity), identity (cloud IAM and enterprise identity providers), and security compliance standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical specialist in core areas such as cloud infrastructure, infrastructure-as-code (IaC), cloud networking, and identity management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support technical wins in competitive scenarios by demonstrating Databricks&#39; differentiation through custom-built solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional resources (DSAs, SAs, FDE, Partners) to contribute to solutions for complex customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate with growing autonomy on well-scoped engagements, with guidance from senior architects on the most complex designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence product direction by providing structured feedback on customer requirements and competitive gaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Look For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in solutions architecture, technical pre-sales, or a Network architecture hands-on technical role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise across the following areas:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Identity:&lt;/strong&gt; Cloud security controls, platform/network/data security, encryption, vulnerability management, compliance, and identity protocols. This includes cloud-native IAM (AWS IAM, Microsoft Entra ID / Azure AD, Google Cloud IAM), enterprise identity services (AWS IAM Identity Center, Entra ID, Google Cloud Identity), and federation standards (SCIM, OAuth, SAML, OIDC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Networking &amp;amp; Deployments:&lt;/strong&gt; Enterprise cloud networking (VPC/VNet design and peering, dedicated interconnects such as AWS Direct Connect / Azure ExpressRoute / Google Cloud Interconnect, and private connectivity such as AWS PrivateLink / Azure Private Link / GCP Private Service Connect), network routing, performance optimisation, and large-scale deployment management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Administration:&lt;/strong&gt; High availability, disaster recovery, cluster orchestration, observability and audit (e.g. Amazon CloudWatch / CloudTrail, Azure Monitor, Google Cloud Operations Suite), and cloud cost management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Automation (InfraOps):&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on automation using IaC tools (e.g. Terraform, plus cloud-native tooling such as AWS CloudFormation / CDK, Azure Resource Manager / Bicep, or Google Cloud Deployment Manager) to build, maintain, and scale complex cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong coding proficiency in Python and PySpark/Spark: you must demonstrate live coding, debugging, and solution-building skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grounding in distributed data systems architecture: scalable pipelines, streaming architectures, lakehouse patterns, and cloud-native data platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient on the Databricks Platform (or demonstrated ability to achieve proficiency rapidly) with a developing technical specialisation in one area (e.g. real-time/streaming, ML/AI, data governance, migrations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to contribute to architecture discussions with senior technical stakeholders: whiteboarding, design reviews, and trade-off analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of driving platform adoption and consumption growth within accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Field Engineering thought leadership through customer-facing content, workshops, and community engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills: able to translate complex architectures into business value for both technical and executive audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a quantitative discipline (or equivalent experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 30% as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks certifications (Data Engineer, ML, Platform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud provider certifications at professional level (e.g. AWS Certified Solutions Architect – Professional or AWS Certified Data Engineer; Azure Solutions Architect Expert; Google Professional Cloud Architect)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with competitive platforms (Snowflake, cloud-native data services, Azure Synapse, BigQuery), understanding the landscape you&#39;ll position against&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in a data/AI company or cloud provider&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;À propos du poste&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un(e) Head of Integrated Marketing France pour rejoindre notre équipe Marketing France, basée à Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rattaché(e) à la Head of Marketing France, vous piloterez l&#39;une des trois équipes Marketing du marché français et managerez une équipe de 3 personnes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre mission : être le point de connexion entre la stratégie Global et son exécution sur le marché France, en fédérant l&#39;ensemble des parties prenantes autour d&#39;une vision marketing claire, cadrée et exécutée dans les temps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;À la croisée de la stratégie, de l&#39;orchestration et de l&#39;exécution, vous porterez la vision marketing France auprès du Global et des instances exécutives locales, tout en veillant à ce que chaque campagne — globale ou locale — soit livrée avec excellence et dans les délais. Vous piloterez également le programme de fidélité en France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Vos missions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et porter la vision stratégique marketing France, en s&#39;appuyant sur une compréhension fine de la stratégie Global et en assurant sa traduction pertinente sur le marché français (spécificités locales : créa, moments de consommation, culture...).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Être l&#39;interlocuteur constructif du Global : savoir s&#39;intégrer dans une stratégie globale tout en la challengeant de façon argumentée lorsque les spécificités françaises le nécessitent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fédérer l&#39;ensemble des pôles (Sales, Brand &amp;amp; Media, Creative, CRM, Analytics, Global...) pour s&#39;assurer que chacun travaille vers les mêmes objectifs et dans le même calendrier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter et sécuriser le calendrier de livraison des campagnes (globales et locales) : brief à temps, validation des plans média, validation brand, etc., pour garantir une exécution sans accroc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplifier et cadrer des sujets complexes impliquant de multiples parties prenantes, en faisant émerger les décisions à prendre et en portant les recommandations qui en découlent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formaliser et présenter la vision et la performance marketing France à un niveau exécutif, avec clarté et impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter le programme de fidélité en France, en garantissant sa cohérence avec la stratégie marketing globale et les priorités business locales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intégrer l&#39;IA dans les méthodes de travail de l&#39;équipe, pour gagner en efficacité et en qualité d&#39;exécution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manager et développer une équipe de 3 personnes, en apportant vision, coaching, structure et exigence d&#39;exécution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Le profil recherché&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous êtes un(e) leader marketing structuré(e), reconnu(e) pour votre capacité à simplifier des sujets complexes multi-stakeholders et à faire en sorte que les choses avancent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous apportez notamment :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 ans et plus d&#39;expérience en marketing, avec une expérience significative dans des environnements matriciels et multi-marchés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une capacité avérée à travailler à l&#39;interface du Global et du Local, en sachant à la fois s&#39;aligner sur une stratégie globale et la challenger de façon constructive quand nécessaire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un leadership naturel pour fédérer, cadrer et orchestrer des sujets impliquant de nombreuses parties prenantes, sans lien hiérarchique direct sur la plupart d&#39;entre elles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une forte capacité de formalisation et de communication, notamment pour porter une vision ou une recommandation devant un public exécutif.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une orientation PMO marquée : rigueur, sens du détail, capacité à garder le contrôle sur des plannings complexes et à faire respecter les délais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une appétence pour l&#39;IA et son intégration dans les méthodes de travail marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une expérience réussie en management et dans le développement de talents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une maîtrise courante du français et de l&#39;anglais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Les compétences qui feront votre réussite&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership et fédération d&#39;équipes transverses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplification et cadrage de sujets complexes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sens de l&#39;organisation et rigueur (PMO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacité à challenger de façon constructive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication et formalisation à niveau exécutif&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gestion de projet et respect des délais&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appétence pour l&#39;IA et les nouveaux outils&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management et développement de talents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance du média (brand et performance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orientation business, à l&#39;aise avec la data et le reporting chiffré&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Airship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship is trusted by world’s leading brands such as Alaska Airlines, BBC and The Home Depot to drive revenue growth and customer loyalty with exceptional cross-channel customer experiences. Today, brands are challenged to deliver seamless, unified customer experiences across a fragmented array of channels and devices— apps, websites, email, SMS, wallets and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship’s no-code, AI-powered platform was designed with non-technical, growth-focused teams in mind, making it easy to create, test and orchestrate hyper-personalized experiences across all channels. With the ability to easily enrich customer data and rapidly launch growth experiments, Airship enables brands to deliver consistent, meaningful interactions that accelerate conversion and foster deeper customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invite you to be part of our journey in building products and delivering services that touch millions of customers around the world every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To learn more about us, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.airship.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.airship.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1727358600004000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3xEidfNT5kaSMR1LbqH2tz&quot;&gt;www.airship.com&lt;/a&gt;, read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.airship.com/blog/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.airship.com/blog/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1727358600004000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2S7rp6uesS3WbpmG9CFOaR&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt; or follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/airship-social&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.linkedin.com/company/airship-social&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1727358600004000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2T3DnwhcK_pt63jzkrYdK6&quot;&gt;LinkedIn.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About the Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Backend Java Engineer, you will design, develop, and support distributed systems that&amp;nbsp;combine scale with high reliability. You will work on low-latency services that process&amp;nbsp;continuous event streams and support analytical workloads across terabytes of data.&amp;nbsp;Our backend infrastructure runs on Google Cloud Platform. It uses Java-based microservices&amp;nbsp;and SQL and NoSQL databases. You will join a core engineering team that shapes Airship’s&amp;nbsp;technical foundations and engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design data schemas and take ownership of data semantics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain, improve, and scale Java APIs and distributed services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate performance issues using server metrics, application data, and system&amp;nbsp;behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the reliability, testability, and maintainability of our backend systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product and engineering teams on technical design and implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define technical standards across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and own large-scale releases and technical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI as a technical assistant to draft development plans and investigate problems or&amp;nbsp;bugs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critically assess AI-generated suggestions for accuracy, security, and suitability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duties and responsibilities described are not comprehensive. Additional tasks may be&amp;nbsp;assigned, or the role’s scope may change based on business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least three years of experience designing, operating, and maintaining distributed&amp;nbsp;systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in spoken and written French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Java development skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with unit testing, code reviews, documentation, and Git-based version&amp;nbsp;control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading significant releases or technical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with continuous integration and continuous delivery practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and pragmatic approach to software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to building reliable, maintainable, and testable systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We&#39;d Be Delighted If You Also Have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience troubleshooting and improving JVM performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Google Cloud Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of distributed NoSQL databases or key-value stores&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Linux administration fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Work Location &amp;amp; Travel Requirements&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship’s ‘Digital First’ approach to work means that for the majority of our roles, work can be performed remotely, either some or most of the time. Airship believes that flexible work contributes to a more productive and more equitable work environment, and that Airshippers are able to collaborate, innovate, and support one another across different locations and timezones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some roles may require that employees perform their work from a specific location to support business activities, and/or be within proximity to an Airship office location or customer or partner locations, while other roles can be performed 100% remotely.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is &lt;strong&gt;fully remote&lt;/strong&gt; and may require &lt;strong&gt;up to 10%&lt;/strong&gt; travel based on business needs or as requested by your manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Compensation&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Starting pay may vary based on factors such as relevant skills, work experience, market demands, and location. All offers include stock options so employees have the opportunity to benefit from Airship’s success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance options for you and your dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible time off, paid holidays, paid parental leave, and paid volunteer time off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support for your overall wellbeing with employer-subsidized mental health and employee wellness programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A digital-first work environment and a monthly stipend to support remote work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship and growth opportunities to build skills and accelerate professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;AI in Recruiting&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use artificial intelligence tools in our recruitment process as decision-support tools only. Airship&#39;s People Operations team reviews all AI-generated scores and recommendations before making any hiring determination. No applicant is rejected solely on the basis of an AI-generated output.&amp;nbsp;Depending on your location, you may have the right to request human review of any AI-assisted employment decision or to opt out of AI evaluation. To make a request or learn more about how we use AI in hiring, contact &lt;a ----- ----- or visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://airship.com/legal&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;airship.com/legal&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;View our EU and UK Candidate Privacy Notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.airship.com/legal/eu-and-uk-candidate-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**&lt;strong&gt;Please Note:&lt;/strong&gt; To ensure the security of your personal information, Airship will only contact candidates through email addresses ending with ----- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Hiring Commitment&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Airship is committed to fostering a diverse work environment and providing equal employment opportunities to all applicants and employees. We welcome your application and our hiring and employment decisions are made irrespective of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status or any other characteristic protected by law. In alignment with our commitment to equal opportunity, Airship will consider for employment all qualified applicants, including those with criminal histories, in a way that adheres to the principles of fairness and the requirements of local Fair Chance laws, where applicable.&lt;/p&gt;
